# Quality bar

A short is a **vertical drama**, not a slideshow of prompts.

**Must**

- 1080×1920 @ 30fps, VO + karaoke ASS, duration = probed audio.
- One still per scene; 1–3 shots share `still_id`. Faces come from the Character Bible passport, not a new description.
- Shots follow beat lenses: hook zoom_in → conflict tight → rising pan → twist punch-in → ending zoom_out.
- Image: photographic stills when Pollinations is on. Compact prompt leads with **ONLY on-camera ids**, wardrobe, location. Kontext from the passport **URL**. Fail the still rather than mix stick figures. Inserts: no full-body crowd.
- Motion: I2V when `HF_TOKEN` or Pollinations pollen exists. Else Ken Burns at 2× canvas + cosine ease. Never call that I2V.
- Motion prompt = camera + action only. No VO text in image/video prompts.

**Must not**

- One image per sentence. Pexels as the picture. Fun-fact / explainer beats.
- Hardcoding Kling/Veo/OpenMontage in the planner. Forking those repos.
- Shipping a still as if people were animated. Write `render/motion.json` (`kenburns` | `i2v` | `mixed`).

When quality is “not OK”, fix identity (bible → kontext) or motion (I2V keys / Ken Burns lenses). Do not add a new product surface.
